// zakcod4.mjs - run this INSTEAD of zakcod2 / zakcod3 (it picks up from
// whichever of those you already ran).
//
//   - COD is detected even when the payment app leaves the gateway blank
//   - the real order total instead of "INR 0"
//   - the balance due instead of the total
//   - tracking page: "Cash on delivery - INR 449" or "Prepaid"
//   - tracking page: example text in the boxes reads as a hint, not as
//     something already typed
//   - tracking page colours fixed for a dark theme
//
// Run from the project root:   node zakcod4.mjs

